💬 Response:
### 🇸🇬 Google Cloud Singapore (SG) Regional Capabilities in 2026
Google Cloud has introduced significant localized capabilities for **Singapore (SG)**, specifically tailored to **Gemini Enterprise** (Standard and Plus editions) and **Gemini Notebook Enterprise**. These additions are designed to help enterprises in Singapore meet stringent local compliance, data sovereignty, and performance standards.
The key capabilities, models, and limitations announced for the Singapore region this year are outlined below:
---
### 🔒 Regional Data Sovereignty & Processing (GA with Allowlist)
The Singapore (**SG**) region is available in **General Availability (GA) with an allowlist**. To activate these capabilities, organizations must contact their Google account team to be added to the regional allowlist. Once enabled, you gain access to:
| Capability | Scope & Commitments |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Data Residency (at-rest DRZ)** | Ensures your primary customer data is stored securely at-rest within physical Google Cloud infrastructure in Singapore. |
| **Local ML Processing (MLP)** | Guarantees that active AI workloads, model tuning, predictions, and training run within the Singapore regional boundaries. |
---
### 🧠 Model Availability in the Singapore Region
Model support varies depending on your regional data commitments. The table below outlines which models are supported natively under Singapore's local DRZ and MLP commitments, and which require global routing:
| Model | Local SG Support Status | Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Gemini 3.5 Flash** | **Supported** | Full in-region at-rest DRZ and local MLP. |
| **Gemini 2.5 Pro** | **Not Supported** | Not offered natively under local Singapore processing. |
| **Gemini 3.6 Flash** | **Global Only** | Available only via global routing (requires administrators to accept a global traffic-routing warning). |
| **Gemini 3.1 Pro** | **Not Supported** | Local DRZ and MLP are currently unavailable for this model in Singapore. |
---
### 🛠️ Locally Hosted Enterprise Tooling
Singapore's regional infrastructure fully supports the core suite of Gemini Enterprise base features. The following capabilities run entirely within the region's compliance guardrails:
*   **Workspace & Federated Search:** Secure search across your ingested or federated enterprise connectors.
*   **Custom Agents & Workflows:** Building, hosting, and deploying custom AI agents using the **Agent Designer**, **Agent Engine**, and **Agent Registry**.
*   **Canvas Integration:** Co-creating and editing AI-generated presentations or documents directly inside your regional chats.
*   **Model Armor:** Local template support for proactive screening of inputs and outputs.
⚠️ **Regional Watchouts:** Certain advanced generative features—such as **Image Generation**, **Video Generation**, **Grounding with Google Search**, and **Notebook Content Studio** (audio overviews/infographics)—cannot guarantee local processing and are routed globally.
---
### 💡 Recommendation
If your organization **does not** have strict regulatory, legal, or government-mandated requirements to keep data within Singapore, Google recommends using the **Global region**. The Global region provides significantly faster response times, immediate access to the latest model versions (like Gemini 3.6 Flash and Gemini 3.1 Pro), and the newest features as they release.
---
